  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">webinar on “Importance of Data science”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDepartment of Computer Science &amp; Engineering in association with ATME college of engineering Alumni association is organizing a webinar on ” *Importance of Data science in the modern world*” On 22nd June 2021 from 10AM to 11AM through MS teams platform .\n\n<strong> Speaker</strong>\n\nShashank S\n\nATMECE Alumni\n\nApplication Specialist\n\nKoch Business Solution,Bengaluru\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Link for webinar registration</strong>\n\n<a href=\"https://forms.gle/GRo3mse833hkiiE3A\">https://forms.gle/GRo3mse833hkiiE3A</a>\n\n<strong>Principal</strong>\n\nDr. Basavaraj L\n\nATMECE\n\n<strong>Prof and Head</strong>\n\nDr Puttegowda D\n\nDept of CSE\n\nATMECE\n\n<strong>Coordinator</strong>\n\nMrs Akshatha A\n\nAsst Prof CSE\n\nATMECE\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
